---
// Scroll candle — a single tall candle in the right gutter, printing in
// sync with scroll progress, completing exactly at the bottom of the
// page. Directional: scrolling down it prints down in red (bearish),
// scrolling up it prints up in green (bullish) — the same candle flips
// color and direction with scroll direction in real time. Ghost = faint
// full outline, print = clipped reveal, tip = glowing frontier. Never
// autoplay, pointer-events none, edge-bound so it never covers text.
// Dims under Moon mood; fully printed and static under reduced motion.
// Narrow on mobile. Positioned absolute inside .rb-contentsWrapper
// (the sampler's rail inside #blueSite). Logic lives in HomeScripts.
---
<div class="b-bear-rail" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="b-bear-sticky" id="bBearSticky">
    <div class="b-bear-ghost"><span class="b-bear-wick"></span><span class="b-bear-body"></span></div>
    <div class="b-bear-print" id="bBearPrint"><span class="b-bear-wick"></span><span class="b-bear-body"></span></div>
    <span class="b-bear-tip"></span>
  </div>
</div>
